{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30001","headline":"春雨如膏 · 喻凫","name":"春雨如膏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幂幂敛轻尘，蒙蒙湿野春。\n细光添柳重，幽点溅花匀。\n惨淡游丝景，阴沈落絮辰。\n回低飞蝶翅，寒滴语禽身。\n洒岳摧余雪，吹江叠远苹。\n东城与西陌，晴後趣何新。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"喻凫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30001.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30001","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}